:''Abilities used on X enemies are more effective!''
The '''Fruit Treasures''' are a type of [[Treasure]]. This group includes the [[Void Fruit]], [[Blood Fruit]], [[Sky Fruit]] and [[Heaven's Fruit]] from [[Into the Future]], and the [[Titanium Fruit]], [[Antimatter Fruit]] and [[Enigma Fruit]] from [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. They improve the effect of certain [[Special Abilities|special abilities]] such as [[Strong Against]] and [[Freeze]], but each one is limited to a certain trait - [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]], [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]], [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]], [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] and [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]], respectively.

Despite making Aliens easier to defeat, the [[Enigma Fruit]] is not considered as one of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]] nor [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], which have an entirely different effect.

==Effect==
These Treasures affect most [[Special Abilities|special abilities]] that are limited to certain types of enemies. Each Fruit Treasure is limited to one type and with all seven activated, the only anti-trait abilities that will not get the bonus are those targeting [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]], [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] or [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] enemies.

