==Trivia==
*The Fruit Treasures originally only improved the Weaken effect's duration by 10% and the Knockback effect's distance by 20%. This was changed at an unknown date.
*Even though the Titanium Fruit does boost Strong Against, Massive Damage and Insane Damage, they will not affect Metal enemies unless combined with a Critical Hit, as non-Critical hits still deal only one damage.

